  "details": "1. Be In the open-beta\n\n2. Launch VRChat\n\n3. Join one of the affected worlds\n\n(E.g https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_934866c2-f34f-4cd9-95fa-bb62c89de41d)\n\nThe game should skip the \"Connection\" phase and spawn you at world origin (0, 0, 0), after some instants the world will render all pink, sending you back home.\n\nAttached is a showcase of the issue while in Desktop mode.",
